{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1734533266"}, "name":{"label":"Asadstar2015"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-02T08:53:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.52"}, "id":{"label":"14619371941"}, "title":{"label":"Some features you should add"}, "content":{"label":"I just love this game. I play it so much all the time but there are some weird things like some weird things happen and it needs features so in the new version you should be able to get a double jump and in creative you would need to triple tap the jump button to fly and sometimes the biomes are under the larger. I mean I have been l grinding for four hours on a world and I still couldn’t get out of the Taiga biome.  And sometimes it is just impossible to find a village and first you pay for the game then you have to pay for costumes add-ons and multiplayer. I mean it’s just makes no sense. Why do we have to pay a paid game? And please give me an end update and I have noticed that lot versions just give us bug fixes. I mean we should give at least even a new feature even if it is is simple. and we should be able to make a different coloured that be different types of walls so that when you can’t find a certain colour of sheep, you don’t have to explore the whole world.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=479516143&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1706482074"}, "name":{"label":"Sly-Moose"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-02T07:26:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.52"}, "id":{"label":"14619069997"}, "title":{"label":"The cushions on mobile are severely nerfed"}, "content":{"label":"Idk if it's a technical limitation, but it only allows one cushion per block, and you can't even place it in the in-betweens of a block (ex: the bottom platform of the lectern for instance)\n\nRemaining Bugs: So the Wilderness Bound glitches are still somewhat present (your skin doesn't save whenever the game reloads) And the screen did go glitchy (glitched flickering) after I left the game paused in the background for too many times in a row (restarting game helped)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=479516143&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
